/-!
# Open subgroups of `GL₂(ℤ̂)` and their levels

Every open subgroup `H` of `GL₂(ℤ̂)` contains some principal congruence subgroup `Gamma N`. The
**level** of `H` (`H.level`) is the least positive integer `N` with `Gamma N ≤ H`, and it divides
every other modulus `M` with `Gamma M ≤ H`. For any `N` divisible by `H.level`, open subgroups
containing `Gamma N` correspond order-isomorphically to subgroups of `GL₂(ℤ / N)`
(`GL2Zhat.orderIsoLevelSubgroup N`), preserving both index and projective index.

Two further invariants of an open subgroup `H` are its determinant subgroup
`H.detSubgroup ≤ ℤ̂ˣ` (open, hence of finite determinant level `H.detLevel ∣ H.level`, with
`H.IsFullDet` meaning `det : H → ℤ̂ˣ` is surjective) and its `±`-saturation `H.pm` (whose index is
the projective index of `H`). Open subgroups of coprime levels intersect cleanly with multiplicative
index (`GL2Zhat.index_inf_of_coprime_level`). Conjugation in `GL₂(ℤ̂)` preserves `level`, `index`,
`projectiveIndex`, `detSubgroup`, `detLevel`, `IsFullDet`, and membership of `-1`. Finally, each
`ℓ`-adic projection `H.projOpenSubgroup ℓ` is an open subgroup of `GL₂(ℤ_ℓ)` with prime-power
local level `(H.projOpenSubgroup ℓ).localLevel ∣ ℓ ^ v_ℓ(H.level)`, and equals `GL₂(ℤ_ℓ)`
whenever `ℓ ∤ H.level`.

## Main definitions

* `OpenSubgroup.level`, `OpenSubgroup.levelPNat`: the minimal positive `N` with `Gamma N ≤ H`.
* `TauCeti.GL2Zhat.orderIsoLevelSubgroup`: order isomorphism between `{H // Gamma N ≤ H}` and
  `Subgroup (GL (Fin 2) (ZMod N))`.
* `OpenSubgroup.pm`: the open subgroup `±H` generated by `H` and `-1`.
* `OpenSubgroup.detSubgroup`, `OpenSubgroup.detLevel`, `OpenSubgroup.detLevelPNat`,
  `OpenSubgroup.IsFullDet`: determinant image, determinant level, and surjectivity of the
  determinant on `H`.
* `TauCeti.GL2Zhat.conj`: conjugation of an open subgroup of `GL₂(ℤ̂)`.
* `OpenSubgroup.projOpenSubgroup`: the `ℓ`-adic image of `H` as an open subgroup of `GL₂(ℤ_ℓ)`.

## Main results

* `TauCeti.GL2Zhat.Gamma_le_iff`: `Gamma N ≤ H ↔ H.level ∣ N`.
* `OpenSubgroup.level_inf`: `(H₁ ⊓ H₂).level = Nat.lcm H₁.level H₂.level`.
* `TauCeti.GL2Zhat.index_eq_index_map_red`,
  `TauCeti.GL2Zhat.projectiveIndex_eq_projectiveIndex_map_red`: index and projective index agree
  with those of the image in `GL₂(ℤ / N)` whenever `Gamma N ≤ H` (respectively `Gamma N ≤ H.pm`).
* `TauCeti.GL2Zhat.index_inf_of_coprime_level`:
  `[GL₂(ℤ̂) : H₁ ⊓ H₂] = [GL₂(ℤ̂) : H₁] · [GL₂(ℤ̂) : H₂]` when `H₁.level` and `H₂.level` are
  coprime.
* `TauCeti.GL2Zhat.detGamma_le_iff`, `OpenSubgroup.detLevel_dvd_level`,
  `TauCeti.GL2Zhat.isFullDet_iff_detLevel_eq_one`, `TauCeti.GL2Zhat.isFullDet_iff_map_red_det`.
* `OpenSubgroup.ker_redPadicPow_factorization_le`,
  `OpenSubgroup.localLevel_projOpenSubgroup_dvd`,
  `OpenSubgroup.projOpenSubgroup_eq_top_of_not_dvd_level`.

## References

* D. Zywina, *On the possible images of the mod `ℓ` representations associated to elliptic curves
  over `ℚ`*, arXiv:1508.07660, §3.
-/

public section

namespace TauCeti

open Matrix

